/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Evaluation\040of\040Sentiment\040Analysis\040in\040Finance\072\040From\040Lexicons\040to\040Transformers)
/Author (Kostadin\040Mishev\054\040Ana\040Gjorgjevikj\054\040Irena\040Vodenska\054\040Lubomir\040T\056\040Chitkushev\054\040Dimitar\040Trajanov)
/Subject (Financial\040and\040economic\040news\040is\040continuously\040monitored\040by\040financial\040market\040participants\056\040According\040to\040the\040efficient\040market\040hypothesis\054\040all\040past\040information\040is\040reflected\040in\040stock\040prices\040and\040new\040information\040is\040instantaneously\040absorbed\040in\040determining\040future\040stock\040prices\056\040Hence\054\040prompt\040extraction\040of\040positive\040or\040negative\040sentiments\040from\040news\040is\040very\040important\040for\040investment\040decision\055making\040by\040traders\054\040portfolio\040managers\040and\040investors\056\040Sentiment\040analysis\040models\040can\040provide\040an\040efficient\040method\040for\040extracting\040actionable\040signals\040from\040the\040news\056\040However\054\040financial\040sentiment\040analysis\040is\040challenging\040due\040to\040domain\055specific\040language\040and\040unavailability\040of\040large\040labeled\040datasets\056\040General\040sentiment\040analysis\040models\040are\040ineffective\040when\040applied\040to\040specific\040domains\040such\040as\040finance\056\040To\040overcome\040these\040challenges\054\040we\040design\040an\040evaluation\040platform\040which\040we\040use\040to\040assess\040the\040effectiveness\040and\040performance\040of\040various\040sentiment\040analysis\040approaches\054\040based\040on\040combinations\040of\040text\040representation\040methods\040and\040machine\055learning\040classifiers\056\040We\040perform\040more\040than\040one\040hundred\040experiments\040using\040publicly\040available\040datasets\054\040labeled\040by\040financial\040experts\056\040We\040start\040the\040evaluation\040with\040specific\040lexicons\040for\040sentiment\040analysis\040in\040finance\040and\040gradually\040build\040the\040study\040to\040include\040word\040and\040sentence\040encoders\054\040up\040to\040the\040latest\040available\040NLP\040transformers\056\040The\040results\040show\040improved\040efficiency\040of\040contextual\040embeddings\040in\040sentiment\040analysis\040compared\040to\040lexicons\040and\040fixed\040word\040and\040sentence\040encoders\054\040even\040when\040large\040datasets\040are\040not\040available\056\040Furthermore\054\040distilled\040versions\040of\040NLP\040transformers\040produce\040comparable\040results\040to\040their\040larger\040teacher\040models\054\040which\040makes\040them\040suitable\040for\040use\040in\040production\040environments\056)
/Keywords (16\040Jul\0402020\054\040IEEE\040Access\054\040Sentiment\040analysis\054\040Efficient\055market\040hypothesis\054\040Saints\040Cyril\040and\040Methodius\040University\040of\040Skopje\054\040Boston\040University)
